{"questionId":"u13-s012-v001","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"一個正數 x 與 x+3 的乘積為 40，x 為何？","givenConditions":"x>0。","target":"求正數","choices":["-8","8","4","5"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"列 x²+3x-40=0；分解 (x+8)(x-5)=0，取 5，所以答案為「5」。 由「正數 x 與 x+3 的乘積」直接列 x(x+3)=40，整理後兩個代數根是五與負八。五乘八正好是四十，而負八違反 x>0，所以只有五符合全部條件。","steps":["列 x²+3x-40=0","分解 (x+8)(x-5)=0，取 5","代回正根檢查 5(5+3)=40，並以 x>0 排除負八。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"-8","truth":false,"reason":"代數根但不是正數。"},{"choice":"8","truth":false,"reason":"8·11≠40。"},{"choice":"4","truth":false,"reason":"4·7=28。"},{"choice":"5","truth":true,"reason":"x(x+3)=40，根 5、-8，取正值。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只解方程不看正值 解出負八後必須回到「正數」條件，不能因它是方程式根就保留。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":75,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"正值唯一。","difficultyReason":"最基本文字乘積。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求正數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"d6d93cf30864c61d4cb01883ec309ae6b23522a79234f758bb01da64875dd081"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v002","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"某正數的平方比它的 5 倍多 24。這個正數為何？","givenConditions":"x>0。","target":"翻譯「多 24」","choices":["-3","5","8","24"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"x²-5x-24=0；(x-8)(x+3)=0，取 8，所以答案為「8」。 「平方比五倍多二十四」表示 x²=5x+24，不是平方再乘二十四。移項後因式為 (x-8)(x+3)，候選根八與負三中，只有八是題目指定的正數。","steps":["x²-5x-24=0","(x-8)(x+3)=0，取 8","將 x=8 代回驗算：64 比 40 多 24，語句與數值一致。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"-3","truth":false,"reason":"是代數根但不是正數。"},{"choice":"5","truth":false,"reason":"把倍數係數當答案。"},{"choice":"8","truth":true,"reason":"列 x²=5x+24，根 8、-3，取 8。"},{"choice":"24","truth":false,"reason":"把差額當答案。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把多寫成乘或忽略正值 「多二十四」是加法差額，不是倍數；翻譯錯誤會導致完全不同的方程式。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":80,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"句子表示 x²-5x=24。","difficultyReason":"語意列式。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"翻譯「多 24」","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"e2fe8b6b3424487a6e06aa29632cd0f59e6d1f45c5a337f60612adbf66d2aeae"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v003","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"兩個相差 4 的正數乘積為 45，較小數為何？","givenConditions":"兩數皆正且較大=較小+4。","target":"求較小正數","choices":["5","9","-9","-5"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"x(x+4)=45；(x+9)(x-5)=0，較小正數 5，所以答案為「5」。 設較小數為 x，「相差四」使較大數成為 x+4，所以乘積式是 x(x+4)=45。解得五與負九，負九不是正數；五與九的差為四、乘積為四十五，且題目問的正是較小數。","steps":["x(x+4)=45","(x+9)(x-5)=0，較小正數 5","以數對 (5,9) 同時檢查正數、差為四與乘積四十五。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"5","truth":true,"reason":"設較小 x，另一數 x+4，得 x=5。"},{"choice":"9","truth":false,"reason":"這是較大數。"},{"choice":"-9","truth":false,"reason":"負根且不是正數。"},{"choice":"-5","truth":false,"reason":"不符合正數。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把較大數當所求或保留負組 求出五後還要區分較小數與較大數，不能把 x+4=9 當成所求。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":80,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"答案問較小者。","difficultyReason":"固定差乘積。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求較小正數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"79f15faf550d45c7d4d7f8273cedfa30362bf4287782cb1747c5a27cd312fb88"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v004","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"甲的年齡比乙大 3 歲，兩人年齡乘積為 70。若兩人皆為正整數，乙幾歲？","givenConditions":"年齡為正整數。","target":"求較小年齡","choices":["10 歲","7 歲","5 歲","14 歲"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"x²+3x-70=0；(x+10)(x-7)=0，取 x=7，所以答案為「7 歲」。 題目問乙，因此設乙為 x 最直接，甲就是 x+3。年齡乘積七十給出 x(x+3)=70，根為七與負十。年齡必須是正整數，故乙七歲、甲十歲，兩者乘積七十。","steps":["x²+3x-70=0","(x+10)(x-7)=0，取 x=7","將乙七歲與甲十歲代回，確認年齡差三歲且乘積為七十。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"10 歲","truth":false,"reason":"這是甲的年齡。"},{"choice":"7 歲","truth":true,"reason":"設乙 x，甲 x+3，x(x+3)=70，正根 7。"},{"choice":"5 歲","truth":false,"reason":"5·8=40。"},{"choice":"14 歲","truth":false,"reason":"14·17≠70。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"人物角色對調 人物定義若對調，十歲雖是同一組年齡，卻不是題目所問的乙。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":90,"unitCheck":"年齡單位歲。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"乙是較小者。","difficultyReason":"角色與乘積建模。","literacyContextNecessity":"年齡關係決定 x+3，正整數性排除負根。","authoringIntent":"求較小年齡","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"dad54880a7730557c364081134564e7063b36caba2e4f29f17da6c2874fc6f0e"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v005","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"長方形卡片有 x 排、每排 x+2 張貼紙，共 48 張。x 為何？","givenConditions":"x∈正整數。","target":"求排數","choices":["-8","8","6","24"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"x²+2x-48=0；(x+8)(x-6)=0，取 6，所以答案為「6」。 貼紙總數等於排數乘每排張數，因此應列 x(x+2)=48，而不是將四十八直接除以二。方程式根六與負八中，排數必須是正整數，所以取六；此時每排八張，總數正好四十八。","steps":["x²+2x-48=0","(x+8)(x-6)=0，取 6","以六排、每排八張回算 6×8=48，並確認八比六多二。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"-8","truth":false,"reason":"負排數不合理。"},{"choice":"8","truth":false,"reason":"8·10=80。"},{"choice":"6","truth":true,"reason":"x(x+2)=48，根 6、-8，排數取 6。"},{"choice":"24","truth":false,"reason":"把總數除以 2 而未符合關係。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只看總量或保留負根 總數與「多兩張」不是平均分配關係，不能用四十八除以二代替列式。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":85,"unitCheck":"x 為排數。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"每排 x+2 也需正。","difficultyReason":"陣列建模。","literacyContextNecessity":"排與每排數量的乘積是不可刪除的情境關係。","authoringIntent":"求排數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"b59e9b9fae576d0f8e35b882f82ab389633debae42bba43792b685e918939261"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v006","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"正數 x 的平方與 x 的和為 72，x 為何？","givenConditions":"x>0。","target":"求正數","choices":["-9","9","72","8"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"列 x²+x=72；分解後取正根 8，所以答案為「8」。 文字關係是 x²+x=72，移項後因式為 (x+9)(x-8)，因此代數根是負九與八。題幹已說明 x 為正數，故只留八；回算八的平方六十四再加八，確實等於七十二。","steps":["列 x²+x=72","分解後取正根 8","套用 x>0 排除負九，再以 8²+8=72 回到原語句驗算。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"-9","truth":false,"reason":"代數根但不是正數。"},{"choice":"9","truth":false,"reason":"9²+9=90。"},{"choice":"72","truth":false,"reason":"把總和當 x。"},{"choice":"8","truth":true,"reason":"x²+x-72=(x+9)(x-8)=0。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"未把和關係列式 「平方與 x 的和」是 x²+x，不能把七十二直接當成 x。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":80,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"負根排除。","difficultyReason":"平方加本身。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求正數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"ace6864f4fbe6ac02651af4a5e8d9a9295e0735a197181ec69a6b5590fc40497"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v007","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"120 km 行程中，速度增加 10 km/h 後可少花 1 小時。原速為何？","givenConditions":"x>0 且 x+10>0。","target":"求原速","choices":["-40 km/h","30 km/h","20 km/h","40 km/h"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"設原速 x>0；清分母得 x²+10x-1200=0，根 30、-40，所以答案為「30 km/h」。 原時間是 120/x，加速後是 120/(x+10)，「少一小時」必須寫成原時間減新時間等於一。清分母後的正根三十使兩段時間分別為四小時與三小時，正好差一；負四十不是可能速度。","steps":["設原速 x>0","清分母得 x²+10x-1200=0，根 30、-40","以原速三十回算 120/30-120/40=4-3=1 小時。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"-40 km/h","truth":false,"reason":"代數根但速度不能為負。"},{"choice":"30 km/h","truth":true,"reason":"120/x-120/(x+10)=1，化簡得 x=30 或 -40，取正。"},{"choice":"20 km/h","truth":false,"reason":"時間差 6-4=2 小時。"},{"choice":"40 km/h","truth":false,"reason":"時間差 3-2.4=0.6 小時。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"時間公式或清分母錯 時間應是距離除以速度，而且差式順序必須是原時間減較短的新時間。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":150,"unitCheck":"距離 km、速度 km/h、時間 h。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"速度不可為 0 或負。","difficultyReason":"分式建模後二次方程。","literacyContextNecessity":"距離、提速與節省時間共同形成二次模型。","authoringIntent":"求原速","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"d5640bdcf91f1553e6e9e584e3f97001664e755149383a527f31771d30f32319"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v008","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"某活動分成 n 組，每組 n-2 人，共 80 人，且 n>2。n 為何？","givenConditions":"n 為整數且 n>2。","target":"求組數","choices":["10","-8","8","12"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"n²-2n-80=0；(n-10)(n+8)=0，取 10，所以答案為「10」。 組數是 n，每組人數是 n-2，故總人數給出 n(n-2)=80。分解後得十與負八，但組數必須為整數且大於二，因此只有十；此時每組八人，乘積正好八十。","steps":["n²-2n-80=0","(n-10)(n+8)=0，取 10","將 n=10 代回得十組、每組八人，同時符合整數與 n>2。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"10","truth":true,"reason":"n(n-2)=80，根 10、-8，取 n=10。"},{"choice":"-8","truth":false,"reason":"組數不可為負，違反情境。"},{"choice":"8","truth":false,"reason":"8·6=48。"},{"choice":"12","truth":false,"reason":"12·10=120。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"未驗證每組人數與範圍 除了排除負組數，還要檢查 n-2 所代表的每組人數是否為正。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":95,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"負根排除。","difficultyReason":"雙重數量關係。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求組數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"2249c305ede520fa54797e3ddbef5ad4423f48fdb0ad751050fd232a1385d220"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v009","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"某照片牆有 x 排，每排 x+1 張，共 132 張，x 為正整數。x 為何？","givenConditions":"x∈正整數。","target":"求正整數排數","choices":["-12","12","66","11"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"x²+x-132=0；根 11、-12，取 11，所以答案為「11」。 排數 x 與每排 x+1 是兩個連續正整數，乘積一百三十二導出根十一與負十二。負根不能代表排數；取十一時每排十二張，乘積正是一百三十二。","steps":["x²+x-132=0","根 11、-12，取 11","根據 x 的定義取排數十一，再驗算 11×12=132。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"-12","truth":false,"reason":"排數不可為負，違反情境。"},{"choice":"12","truth":false,"reason":"12·13=156。"},{"choice":"66","truth":false,"reason":"把總數除以 2。"},{"choice":"11","truth":true,"reason":"x(x+1)=132，分解為 (x-11)(x+12)=0。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把相鄰量角色或總量處理錯 十二是每排張數而非排數，角色對調雖不改變乘積，卻會答非所問。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":95,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"每排 x+1。","difficultyReason":"大數乘積分解。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求正整數排數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"b3ec11fa8c81da8c61b17ceaf16e4a828417e86bb0a974a23adce6514724e382"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v010","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"每位參加者收費 300-5n 元，共 n 人，總收入 4000 元；場地最多 30 人。n 為何？","givenConditions":"n 為正整數且 n≤30，單價需合理。","target":"求容量內參加人數","choices":["40","20","30","20 或 40"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"整理得 n²-60n+800=0；根 20、40；n≤30 取 20，所以答案為「20」。 總收入是人數乘每人收費，所以列 n(300-5n)=4000，方程式的二十與四十都是代數根。但場地最多三十人，四十人的方案不可執行；二十人時單價二百元，收入正好四千元。","steps":["整理得 n²-60n+800=0","根 20、40；n≤30 取 20","逐根比較 n≤30，再以 20×(300-5×20)=4000 驗算。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"40","truth":false,"reason":"代數根但超過容量。"},{"choice":"20","truth":true,"reason":"n(300-5n)=4000，根 20、40，容量只留 20。"},{"choice":"30","truth":false,"reason":"容量上限不是自動解。"},{"choice":"20 或 40","truth":false,"reason":"未套用容量。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把上限當答案或忽略另一限制 容量上限三十只是篩選條件，不是方程式的自動答案。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":130,"unitCheck":"收費元、人數人、總收入元。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"40 排除。","difficultyReason":"收入模型與容量篩選。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為票價隨人數改變與場地容量兩項資料都不可刪除。","authoringIntent":"求容量內參加人數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"49bcba1cebab987bf2b7265fab1a0f73ced383aa8cc5cd80877a6bec22ddddf4"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v011","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"包裝機每批放 q 列、每列 q-5 件，共 84 件，且 q>5。q 為何？","givenConditions":"q 為整數且 >5。","target":"求列數","choices":["12","-7","7","14"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"q²-5q-84=0；(q-12)(q+7)=0，取 12，所以答案為「12」。 總件數等於列數 q 乘每列 q-5 件，因此 q(q-5)=84。因式分解給出十二與負七，其中只有十二是大於五的整數；代回後是十二列、每列七件，總共八十四件。","steps":["q²-5q-84=0","(q-12)(q+7)=0，取 12","將 q=12 代回 12(12-5)=84，並確認 q>5。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"12","truth":true,"reason":"q(q-5)=84，根 12、-7，取 12。"},{"choice":"-7","truth":false,"reason":"負列數且不符合 q>5。"},{"choice":"7","truth":false,"reason":"7·2=14。"},{"choice":"14","truth":false,"reason":"14·9=126。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只看差 5 或保留負根 「每列少五件」是 q-5，不能只用差五去猜列數。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":100,"unitCheck":"q 為列數。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"每列 q-5 必為正。","difficultyReason":"包裝陣列與下限。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為q>5 同時保證列數與每列件數可行。","authoringIntent":"求列數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"d88caaae3b7aaf18983d991143a4762c1470a4a27d43c8de341683ded97e25c9"}
{"questionId":"u13-s012-v012","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-word-problem","lockedSkillOrder":12,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"某會員方案有 n 人，每人可獲 n+4 點，總點數 96 點；n 為正整數。n 為何？","givenConditions":"n∈正整數。","target":"求會員人數","choices":["-12","12","8","24"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"n²+4n-96=0；(n+12)(n-8)=0，取 8，所以答案為「8」。 會員人數為 n，每人點數為 n+4，所以總點數關係是 n(n+4)=96。根八與負十二中，只有八是正整數人數；此時每人十二點，八人總計九十六點，同時驗證了兩個量的角色。","steps":["n²+4n-96=0","(n+12)(n-8)=0，取 8","以 n=8 回算每人十二點，且 8×12=96，再排除負人數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"-12","truth":false,"reason":"人數不可為負，違反情境。"},{"choice":"12","truth":false,"reason":"12·16=192。"},{"choice":"8","truth":true,"reason":"n(n+4)=96，根 8、-12，取 8。"},{"choice":"24","truth":false,"reason":"把總點數除以 4。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把固定增加量誤作除法 固定增加四點是加在每人點數，不是把總點數直接除以四。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-formula-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":100,"unitCheck":"n 為人數，點數總量為點。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"總點數與每人點數單位一致。","difficultyReason":"素養式數量模型。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為人數與每人點數相依，必須用乘積而非單一步驟除法。","authoringIntent":"求會員人數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"1aa25386470f1939e3fbac4037fdf0cd98dfc37483bc0d9900cc31f75fc3a79a"}
